{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"hequan-e-o101","title":"鲂笺一遣董岑邵南托叛致休","accounts":[{"id":"hequan-a-cd454a3187de476a4d94","label":"正文","text":"鲂笺一遣董岑邵南托叛致休","evidence":["hequan-q-9ff9d08a0bf29a2067d7"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0058","role":"笺陈千载侥幸得备州民、遣亲人董岑邵南等托叛奉笺、时事变故列于别纸","evidence":["hequan-q-9ff9d08a0bf29a2067d7"]},{"person":"hequan-p0052","role":"托叛赍笺","evidence":["hequan-q-9ff9d08a0bf29a2067d7"]},{"person":"hequan-p0062","role":"托叛赍笺","evidence":["hequan-q-9ff9d08a0bf29a2067d7"]},{"person":"wendi-p0039","role":"笺所致明公君侯","evidence":["hequan-q-9ff9d08a0bf29a2067d7"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["hequan-q-9ff9d08a0bf29a2067d7"]},"ordering_evidence":"hequan-q-9ff9d08a0bf29a2067d7","source_order":[60,256,0],"order":10643}],"persons":[{"id":"hequan-p0062","name":"邵南","evidence":["hequan-q-9ff9d08a0bf29a2067d7"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"hequan-q-9ff9d08a0bf29a2067d7","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-6af46cb9ccb66c3df880","layer":"original","quote":"其一曰：“鲂以千载侥幸，得备州民〖1〗；远隔江川，敬恪未显〖2〗；瞻望云景，天实为之。精诚微薄，名位不昭；虽怀焦渴〖3〗，曷缘见明〖4〗？狐死首丘〖5〗，人情恋本；而逼所制，奉觌礼违〖6〗。每独矫首西顾，未尝不寤寐劳叹〖7〗，展转反侧也！今因隙穴之际，得陈宿昔之志；非神启之，岂能致此？不胜翘企〖8〗，万里托命。谨遣亲人董岑、邵南等，托叛奉笺〖9〗；时事变故，列于别纸。惟明公君侯垂日月之光〖10〗，照远民之趣，永令归命者有所戴赖","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":255,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":215}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
